      "writtenOn": "2017-01-09T01:15:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "a more thorough check would be vefifying that one pair is both weakly pulled down, and the other one has at least one pullup, maybe read the four bits states into a bitmask and vefify that.",
      "revId": "c399c5133e7d88392998bd1d7768521469d83049",
