      "writtenOn": "2017-01-12T18:19:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I changed this section slightly to read all 4 pins and convert that to an 8 bit strap_config value. Either the upper 4 or lower 4 bits will contain the variant and choice of upper or lower can be used to determine if it is the SPI or I2C group. \n\nIdeally the SPI vs I2C selection bits would read 0x5 with 2 weak pulldowns. However, on both Reef and Gru these bits are reading as strong pulldowns, so the code just confirms that no pullups are detected for these 2 pins and that at least one pullup is detected on the other 2 pins.",
      "parentUuid": "97a04ea7_4f70c0f4",
